# 统一换行策略，避免「在我机器上是 LF，在你机器上是 CRLF」这类噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd 下可能无法正常解析
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Shell 脚本与容器配置统一 LF
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# 二进制不做任何换行转换
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.docx binary
*.doc binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary